1
00:00:00,765 --> 00:00:04,515
(Leonard:)Excuse me, your entire argument
is predicated on the assumption...

2
00:00:04,686 --> 00:00:07,026
(Leonard:)...that Superman's flight
is a feat of strength.

3
00:00:07,189 --> 00:00:08,609
Are you listening to yourself?

4
00:00:08,773 --> 00:00:10,943
(Leonard:)Superman's flight is a feat of strength.

5
00:00:11,109 --> 00:00:13,359
(Sheldon:)An extension of his ability
to leap buildings...

6
00:00:13,528 --> 00:00:15,658
(Sheldon:)...an ability he derives
from exposure to sun...

7
00:00:15,822 --> 00:00:17,702
How does he fly at night?

8
00:00:17,866 --> 00:00:19,996
(Sheldon:)A combination
of the moon's solar reflection...

9
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:23,200
(Sheldon:)...and the energy storage capacity
of Kryptonian skin cells.

10
00:00:24,539 --> 00:00:26,289
I'm just gonna go wash up.

11
00:00:26,458 --> 00:00:28,288
I have 2600 comic books in there.

12
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:32,050
(Leonard:)I challenge you to find a single reference
to Kryptonian skin cells.

13
00:00:32,214 --> 00:00:34,464
(Sheldon:)Challenge accepted.

14
00:00:37,302 --> 00:00:38,722
(Sheldon:)We're locked out.

15
00:00:38,887 --> 00:00:42,027
(Raj:)Also, the pretty girl left.

